## Notes
* Fire runes are not charged for: Low Level Alchemy burns 3 of them and any fire staff or tome of fire supplies them free.
* The item is costed at its instant-buy price, on the assumption you want it now rather than after a wait.

=> https://grandexchange.dreamstation.systems/alch?spell=low This page on the web
